<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Hou Junji</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 643</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Hou Junji was a <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/tang-dynasty">Tang dynasty</a> general who served the emperor Taizong. He led campaigns against the Tuyuhun and in 640 conquered the oasis kingdom of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gaochang">Gaochang</a> near <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/turfan">Turpan</a>, which became the Tang prefecture of Xizhou. Implicated in a plot by the crown prince Li Chengqian, he was executed in 643.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/hou-junji.jpg" alt="Hou Junji" width="320" height="459" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: 閻立本, 劉源 · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BE%AF%E5%90%9B%E9%9B%86%EF%BC%88%E6%B7%A9%E7%85%99%E9%96%A3%E5%8A%9F%E8%87%A3%E5%9C%96%E5%83%8F%EF%BC%89.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
